      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "140886bd-8dd5-4c3e-a00a-129c19a8f8a2",
            "command": "EVENT_GROUP",
            "args": {},
            "children": {
              "true": [
                {
                  "id": "e4ccd3c2-7567-43ec-a478-17a70f2d8c84",
                  "command": "EVENT_HIDE_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                },
                {
                  "id": "3b64390a-15c3-49ff-ad21-65fbf363c9d7",
                  "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                  "args": {
                    "text": [
                      "Rivet offers\nRESERVE, holding\nspare seals for\nsudden faults, or\nSHARED, pooling",
                      "orders and\npublishing the\nstock ledger. Each\ncan work if people\nkeep the promise.",
                      "Choose the policy\nthe crew will use\nin later tests."
                    ],
                    "avatarId": "",
                    "minHeight": 4,
                    "maxHeight": 7,
                    "position": "bottom",
                    "closeWhen": "key",
                    "closeButton": "a"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "f80a9e24-1bb7-437b-ae83-d1588425642d",
                  "command": "EVENT_SHOW_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "1dc44095-7f43-40a3-aedd-467e6b449ee5",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 4
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "70126f49-869a-4682-a1bb-909bf19261a5",
            "command": "EVENT_GROUP",
            "args": {},
            "children": {
              "true": [
                {
                  "id": "4339c12c-9d70-4b86-ae6f-0ee0e9dde61c",
                  "command": "EVENT_HIDE_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                },
                {
                  "id": "93f216dd-3ae1-4d0e-a5d7-9e4e17df7b7a",
                  "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                  "args": {
                    "text": [
                      "Which recipe plan\nmeets all three\nconstraints:\nexactly three\nseals, no partial",
                      "batch, and at\nleast two stock\nleft? Read the\noutput as\ncarefully as the",
                      "input. Two small\nbatches may look\neconomical until\nyou count what\nthey make. The",
                      "other crew has\nalready planned a\nrepair around the\nstock you promised\nnot to consume."
                    ],
                    "avatarId": "",
                    "minHeight": 4,
                    "maxHeight": 7,
                    "position": "bottom",
                    "closeWhen": "key",
                    "closeButton": "a"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "b5331d51-9f42-47bb-ab4e-72b2dfd91838",
                  "command": "EVENT_SHOW_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
